sequenceDiagram
  actor Ops as 运维发布
  participant Mig as 迁移作业
  participant DB as StorageBackend SQLite v1
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Sch as Scheduler
  participant W as Worker
  participant R as Runner
  Ops->>Mig: db migrate
  Mig->>DB: SQLite 初始化 / PRAGMA / 统一 Schema
  DB-->>Mig: Schema 版本
  Ops->>API: 启动
  API->>DB: 校验配置和 Schema
  DB-->>API: ready
  Ops->>Sch: 启动 Scheduler / Dispatcher
  Sch->>DB: 扫描 Job / Schedule / Outbox
  Ops->>W: 启动并注册 Graph 版本
  W->>DB: 领取能力匹配的 Job
  Ops->>R: 启动 Runner
  R-->>DB: 执行能力与镜像 digest
